        {
            "author_association": "MEMBER",
            "body": "I thought about it, but didn't quite manage to end up with reasonable rules of when to apply this. I really don't want to introduce functionality that is targeted towards specified plugins. So a a rule of something like \"if Nvim-tree is showed as sidebar...\" is not really good at the moment. Besides, I personally don't really like the visuals of \"moving tabline\" on sidebar toggle.\r\n\r\nI'll study your links and see if I can come up with something I'd like.",
